<div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#008ca6">{!Customer_Journey__c.Main_Contact_Email__c}</div>
</td></tr></table></td></tr>

<tr><td style="background:#ffffff;padding:18px 40px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif">
<div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#008ca6;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px">Other licence contacts</div>
<div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#003340">{!Customer_Journey__c.Other_Licence_contacts__c}</div></td></tr>

<tr><td style="background:#ffffff;padding:22px 40px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif">
<div style="margin-bottom:14px"><div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#008ca6;text-transform:uppercase">Primary use case / challenge</div><div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:4px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#003340">{!Customer_Journey__c.Primary_Use_Case_Challenge__c}</div></div>
<div style="margin-bottom:14px"><div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#008ca6;text-transform:uppercase">Features discussed</div><div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:4px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#003340">{!Customer_Journey__c.Features_discussed__c}</div></div>
<div style="margin-bottom:14px"><div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#008ca6;text-transform:uppercase">Risk / expansion / avoid</div><div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:4px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#003340">{!Customer_Journey__c.Risk_Expansion_Avoid__c}</div></div>
<div><div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#008ca6;text-transform:uppercase">Set-up instructions</div><div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:4px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#003340">{!Customer_Journey__c.Set_Up_Instructions__c}</div></div>
</td></tr>

<tr><td style="background:#ffffff;padding:28px 40px 30px;text-align:center;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif">
<a href="{!MID(Customer_Journey__c.Link, 1, LEN(Customer_Journey__c.Link)-15)}{!Customer_Journey__c.Id}" style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;display:inline-block;background:#00c8a7;color:#003340;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;text-decoration:none;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:8px;letter-spacing:.02em">View customer journey &rarr;</a>
</td></tr>

<tr><td style="background:#003340;padding:26px 40px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif">
<div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;line-height:1;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#ffffff">CE<span style="color:#00c8a7">N</span>TELLIC</div>
<div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#9fc7c6">Global intelligence and information services, setting the standard for how critical business decisions are made.</div>
<div style="font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;margin-top:14px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #0c4a55;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#6f9a9b">Opportunity owner: {!Customer_Journey__c.OwnerFullName} &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Sent automatically from Salesforce on the closed-won handshake.</div>
</td></tr>

